  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Preventive Measures including Vaccination against COVID-19 among Older People in Tanzania.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to work initially in 2 regions with relatively high incidences of COVID 19 and will then aim to scale up lessons learned and best practices in more regions as the context permits. HelpAge in collaboration with WHO and UNICEF will lead, coordinate, and manage the interventions with the local ageing organisations in each region being responsible for the day-to-day implementation of the project activities at the community, district, and regional level in collaboration with the older people forums.</narrative>
  </description>
